anually.\n2. Generated code using Copilot chat, I accept it.\n3. I make some edits to the generated code. \n4. I ask for new code in the chat window again. If I reject the new suggestions, Jupyter notebook goes back to the version after step 2, rather than step 3.\n\nSteps to Reproduce: Happy to provide a screencast, but I just want to check if others have this problem too. It  causes lost work so often. ","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/4613/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/4613/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[]}